  "instructions": [
    "1. Heat butter in a large skillet over medium-high heat.",
    "2. Add chicken and cook until browned, about 5 minutes.",
    "3. Remove chicken from skillet and set aside.",
    "4. Add onion and garlic to skillet and cook until softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "5. Stir in curry powder and cook for 1 minute.",
    "6. Add diced tomatoes and chicken broth to skillet. Stir to combine.",
    "7. Return chicken to skillet and simmer until cooked through, about 10 minutes.",
    "8. Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "9. Serve hot over rice or with naan bread."
